Subject: [PATCH] avcodec: add AV1 decoding through V4L2 Request

Adapt the upstream V4L2 Request AV1 implementation to the FFmpeg 6.0-based
Raspberry Pi FFmpeg APIs used here. Retain the existing Raspberry Pi HEVC
backend and DRM-device contract. Handle complete AV1F OBUs and multiple tile
groups, adapt parser state, reject missing film-grain data, and propagate
decode-completion errors.

This backport depends on the Linux V4L2 AV1 Request controls and formats,
including AV1 frame capture. It does not change the HEVC Request interface.

